graph TD
    A[RNA Degradation Signal] --> B{Decay Pathway?}
    B -->|5' to 3'| C[5' Cap Removal]
    B -->|3' to 5'| D[3' PolyA Removal]
    B -->|Endonucleolytic| E[Endonuclease Cleavage]
    B -->|Nonsense-Mediated| F[NMD Pathway]
    
    C --> G[Decapping Enzyme]
    G --> H[5' Exonuclease]
    H --> I[5' to 3' Decay]
    
    D --> J[Deadenylase]
    J --> K[3' Exonuclease]
    K --> L[3' to 5' Decay]
    
    E --> M[Endonuclease]
    M --> N[RNA Fragment Decay]
    
    F --> O[NMD Factors]
    O --> P[Nonsense-Mediated Decay]
    
    I --> Q[RNA Decay Complete]
    L --> Q
    N --> Q
    P --> Q
    
    %% Alternative pathway
    A --> R[Quality Control]
    R --> S[Defective RNA Recognition]
    S --> T[Quality Control Decay]
    T --> Q
    
    %% Regulation
    Q --> U[Decay Status]
    U --> V{Decay Required?}
    V -->|Yes| W[Decay Activation]
    V -->|No| X[Decay Inhibition]
    
    %% Key proteins
    Y[Decapping Enzymes] --> G
    Z[5' Exonucleases] --> H
    AA[Deadenylases] --> J
    BB[3' Exonucleases] --> K
    CC[Endonucleases] --> M
    DD[NMD Factors] --> O
    EE[Quality Control Factors] --> R
    
